        <h1><a href="/">The Baseball Chronicle</a></h1>
        <h2><span class="entryprev"><a href="https://thebaseballchronicle.com/essays/indian_pirates_on_the_high_seas" title="Previous story">&#8592;</a></span> <a href="https://thebaseballchronicle.com/fiction/">Fiction</a>, July 2009 <span class="entrynext"><a href="https://thebaseballchronicle.com/essays/the_greatest_hitter_of_all_time" title="Next story">&#8594;</a></span</h2>
